     client/assets/fonts/LICENSE-cozette.txt must ship with them.

3. client/assets/ui/title_key_art.webp is team key art (Nhom001).
   client/assets/video/intro.mp4 is an AI-generated clip made with Meta AI and
   still carries the Meta AI watermark; it is used for this non-commercial
